      <div type="clause" n="15">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 15</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be scyldwyrhtum.] [Ld] Feorðe: þæt nan scyldwyrhta ne lecge nan scepes fel on scyld; ⁊ gif he dó, gilde XXX scll'.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Fourthly [we declare] that no shield-maker shall cover a shield with sheepskin. If he does he shall pay 30 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Be scyldwyrhtum. We cwædon, þæt nán scyldwyrhta ne lecge nán sceapes felle on scyld; ⁊ gif he hit dó, gylde XXX scill.</ab>
      </div>
